        <mxCell id="noteEscalate" value="Escalation

A parcel left in the pool for an hour is assigned automatically to the on-duty courier carrying the fewest.

Assignment is not collection — that courier still requests it, and the shop still confirms." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#b45309;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#78350f;" vertex="1" parent="1">
