        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="noteGate" value="Why two parties

A courier pressing &quot;collected&quot; is only their word for it. Until the shop confirms, nobody has actually taken the parcel.

The courier’s name and number reach the customer at picked_up, and not before." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;fillColor=#eef2ff;strokeColor=#4f46e5;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#4338ca;" vertex="1" parent="1">
